---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Character from '../cast/Character.astro';
import Bubble from '../cast/Bubble.astro';
import { resolvePath } from '../utils/paths';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Start Here - How To Live Better"
  description="How to read the guide, evidence grading criteria, and how to get the most value with the least effort."
>
  <article class="prose-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="start-cast-welcome" aria-hidden="true">
        <Character character="plus" mood="happy" size={56} />
        <Bubble speaker="Plus" text="Take your time. Even one pick counts." tailDirection="bottom-left" />
      </div>
      <span class="comic-sticker sticker-benefit">Start Here</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">How To Use This Guide</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        This book is a menu of options, not an onerous task list. Adopting even one or two tips provides immediate, compounding benefits.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">1. You Don't Need To Do Everything</h2>
      <p>
        Most people never implement even a fraction of what they read. That is completely normal—the author has not mastered most of these rules either.
        Treat this site as an evidence-backed reference manual. When a life transition occurs—a new job, a move, childbirth, an aging parent, or a medical diagnosis—turn to the relevant chapter.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">2. Evidence Grading System</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Every single tip in this guide is graded based on the rigor of its underlying source:
      </p>
      <ul class="evidence-list">
        <li>
          <strong class="grade-a">Grade A (495 tips):</strong> Supported by randomized controlled trials (RCTs), systematic meta-analyses, or statutory administrative law. The hardest conclusions available.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="grade-b">Grade B (218 tips):</strong> Supported by large multi-year observational cohorts, official agency statistics, or authoritative clinical guidelines.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="grade-c">Grade C (52 tips):</strong> Supported by expert consensus, single-institution retrospective reviews, or legal regulatory obligations without published mortality impact.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">3. Value-for-Money Tiers (ROI)</h2>
      <p>
        The author calculates a cost score based on three dimensions: <strong>Money</strong> (0 to 2), <strong>Time</strong> (0 to 2), and <strong>Willpower</strong> (0 to 2).
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        When an action requires zero money, negligible time, and zero willpower while producing large benefits, it is ranked <strong>Very High ROI</strong> (122 tips). Start with these for the biggest life wins with the least resistance.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href={resolvePath('/chapters/')} class="action-btn-primary">Explore All Chapters →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .start-cast-welcome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-comic);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    color: var(--theme-text);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--theme-text-muted);
  }

  .info-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-jade);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .evidence-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .grade-a { color: var(--color-jade); }
  .grade-b { color: var(--color-amber); }
  .grade-c { color: var(--color-steel); }

  .cta-row {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .action-btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    background: var(--color-jade);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-capsule);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
